Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 08:55:09 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] PlaitOS: Send nearby (LocalSend) in the selection bar

A main action after Share, wherever Share applies (files, not folders): the same share
intent, handed straight to the bundled LocalSend with no chooser; shown only when LocalSend
is installed and takes files. Bar label "Nearby" (titleCondensed); design-guide nearby icon.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017VXjYUWzBqMCeUoJD2Suc4
